+// Hidden Leaf: HL_IOP_THREAD=1, the IOP (and the SPU2 it drives) on a thread of its own, one batch behind the EE
+// (ps2_runtime.cpp). What the IOP does to the EE's side (writes to its RAM, SIF commands, which run the EE's handlers)
+// is kept and done on the game thread when the next batch is handed over, in the same order.
+namespace hl_iopw
+{
